{"overview":"«گرند پریکس آرزو» بازی‌ای است برای محافظت از صلح شهر در برابر تهدید دشمن مرموز «جیاماتو» که منشا و هدفش ناشناخته است. هر شرکت‌کننده به یک کامن رایدِر تبدیل می‌شود و برای پیروزی در بازی با شکست دشمنان و نجات مردم رقابت می‌کند. برندهٔ گرند پریکس آرزو جایزهٔ «حق آوردن دنیای ایده‌آل به واقعیت» را دریافت می‌کند؛ به عبارت دیگر، تنها قهرمانان واقعی که مسابقه را ببردند می‌توانند دنیای آرزوهایشان را به حقیقت بپیوندند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The \"Desire Grand Prix\" is a game to protect the peace of the city from the threat of the mysterious enemy \"Jyamato\", whose origin and purpose are unknown. Each participant transforms into a Kamen Rider and competes to win the game by defeating enemies and saving people. The winner of the Desire Grand Prix will be rewarded with \"the right to bring an ideal world to life\" as a prize. In other words, only the true heroes who win the competition will be able to realize the world they have wished for.","tagline_en":"This game ― The winner in the end is me.","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":14,"y":2023,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":49,"y":2022,"poster":"/8IcuU5YMAhVhd4czFZhhczLHm4U.jpg"}],"episodes":49,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"簡秀吉","role":"Ace Ukiyo / Kamen Rider Geats","photo":"/ldE0qGsAkQ44kNyrZY0Bu5f36rA.jpg","en":"Hideyoshi Kan"},{"name":"佐藤瑠雅","role":"Keiwa Sakurai / Kamen Rider Tycoon","photo":"/aYtlPKIs45IySkrExZFtyCXU2JE.jpg","en":"Ryuga Sato"},{"name":"星乃夢奈","role":"Neon Kurama / Kamen Rider Na-Go","photo":"/s3oIk1Ks2tkwoH7m4orgCx89yV7.jpg","en":"Yuna Hoshino"},{"name":"杢代和人","role":"Michinaga Azuma / Kamen Rider Buffa","photo":"/fW28CONXfIBriHUBzLGAKiM3dQg.jpg","en":"Kazuto Mokudai"},{"name":"青島心","role":"Tsumuri","photo":"/2pqC4BzlJ2WIw5hx84iOFBhCzQ2.jpg","en":"Kokoro Aoshima"},{"name":"崎山つばさ","role":"Win Hareruya / Kamen Rider PunkJack","photo":"/xvkaCtL5F6tmjpuAe2JXYFFY93z.jpg","en":"Tsubasa Sakiyama"},{"name":"志田音々","role":"S